@startuml
title 4A - Log scan: one scan, N fixes\nOne scan opening N fixes is why LogReviewer and FixImplementer are two machines

skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "Scheduler" as SCH
participant "Orchestrator" as O
participant "Store" as S
participant "SandboxPool" as P
participant "WorkerRunner\n(sandbox)" as R
participant Grafana
participant GitHub

SCH -> O: tick
O -> S: create RequestRouter instance (source=cron)
return rr_resolved
note right of O
  A cron request, so every SandboxRun hangs off a request.
  No exceptions, including the scan.
end note
O -> S: create LogReviewer instance
return lr_pending
O -> P: enqueue SandboxRun(LogReviewer)
O -> S: state
return lr_working
P -> R: execute
R -> Grafana: query logs (MCP)
return log evidence
R -> P: result{findings[0..N]}
P -> O: run finished
O -> S: state
return lr_done

note right of O
  The scan ENDS when the findings exist. It does not wait
  for the fixes: a scan "open because 2 of 5 fixes are
  running" enables no decision, and the grouped report is
  a query by originating scan.
end note

loop for each NEW fingerprint
  O -> S: create FixImplementer instance
  return fi_pending
  O -> P: enqueue SandboxRun(FixImplementer)
  O -> S: state
  return fi_implementing
  P -> R: execute
  R -> R: validate the finding first
  alt a code change is warranted
    R -> GitHub: push branch + open DRAFT PR
    return pr_url
    R -> P: result{pr_url}
    P -> O: run finished
    O -> S: state
    return fi_verifying
    note right of O
      FixVerifier is wired and empty: the release is all this state does.
    end note
    O -> GitHub: mark ready for review
    O -> S: state
    return fi_waiting_pr
    O -> S: create PrMaintainer instance
    return prm_pending
    note right of O
      Hourly: read the PR. Merged -> fi_done, closed -> fi_abandoned.
    end note
  else false positive / unreproducible / outside repo / ...
    R -> P: result{no_pr, reason}
    P -> O: run finished
    O -> S: state
    return fi_discarded
  end
end
@enduml
